    "detailed_description": "In &quot;Oops! Zombie Swarm,&quot; an FPS survival game, an outbreak of an unknown virus has turned most people into zombies. But you have survived, thanks to a mysterious dragon egg nearby, whose magic can shield against the virus. Now, you must use every means to protect this sole beacon of hope.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2>Diverse Arsenal: The game offers a rich selection of weapons, from ancient bows and spears to modern rifles and shotguns, to the primitive yet powerful axe. Each weapon provides a unique combat experience. Choose the one that best suits your fighting style and bravely face the zombie hordes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Thrilling Headshots</h2>The game's shooting mechanics make each precise headshot extremely satisfying. Feel the rush of lethal precision with each shot, finding joy in battle amidst the apocalypse.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1341120/extras/5cf2e8a4c72c8856a5a404b246f6f03f.poster.avif?t=1717918237\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1341120/extras/5cf2e8a4c72c8856a5a404b246f6f03f.webm?t=1717918237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1341120/extras/5cf2e8a4c72c8856a5a404b246f6f03f.mp4?t=1717918237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weapon Upgrades</h2>Coins earned in battle can be used to upgrade your weapons, increasing their rate of fire, damage, and accuracy. Each upgrade makes you more adept at navigating through the zombie masses.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1341120/extras/0dfa9c4342da2360c3b15821efd91a8c.poster.avif?t=1717918237\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1341120/extras/0dfa9c4342da2360c3b15821efd91a8c.webm?t=1717918237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1341120/extras/0dfa9c4342da2360c3b15821efd91a8c.mp4?t=1717918237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Treasure Chest Rewards</h2>Treasure chests hidden in various corners of the game contain rewards ranging from coins to weapons. These random prizes will help you survive better in the game.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1341120/extras/be74508ec7c53487cacdef6c70578826.poster.avif?t=1717918237\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1341120/extras/be74508ec7c53487cacdef6c70578826.webm?t=1717918237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1341120/extras/be74508ec7c53487cacdef6c70578826.mp4?t=1717918237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In this new world of despair and chaos, protecting the magic-filled dragon egg is your ultimate mission. Every battle is a test of your survival skills, and every choice could determine your fate.<br><br>Join &quot;Oops! Zombie Swarm,&quot; find your footing in this challenging survival fight, protect the last hope, and let the light of hope illuminate this dark world.",
